OL,3,GNEWSA'Eating disorders thrive on
OL,4,Aisolation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lives with a binge eating
OL,7,Fdisorder says talking about the issue
OL,8,Fhelps to "break down the stigma".
OL,10,FAnna Binet, 30, from Jersey, reached
OL,11,Fout to Jersey Eating Disorders Support
OL,12,Fin 2020 for help with a binge eating
OL,13,Fdisorder. The charity supported Binet
OL,14,Fthrough different stages of recovery
OL,15,Fover the years, including a period of
OL,16,Fgrief after both of her parents died
OL,17,Fwithin months of each other.
