OL,3,GNEWSA'Eating disorders thrive on
OL,4,Aisolation'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You can be doing really well and then
OL,7,Fsomething happens that pulls you back
OL,8,Ftowards old coping mechanisms," she
OL,9,Fsaid. "Recovery isn't always a straight
OL,10,Fline."
OL,12,FBinet said "eating disorders thrive on
OL,13,Fisolation" and urged sufferers to take
OL,14,Fan "incredibly brave" first step and
OL,15,Fseek help.
